2 CONT
2 CONT Brigitta Catharina Sundström
2 CONT
2 CONT dotter till klockaren Marcus Sundström på Brännan och halvsyster till Anna Dorotea. Makarnas silhuetter finnas hos fru Siri Tersmeden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Namnet bestyrkit av en märkduk förfärdigad av henne själv 1798.
2 CONT
2 CONT ..
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Petter Westling [Parents] was born on 24 Jun 1777 in Luleå, Sweden. He died on 16 Feb 1854. He married Brigitta Catharina Sundström on 20 Mar 1803 in Skellefteå, Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Notes]
2 CONT
2 CONT Brigitta Catharina Sundström [Parents] was born on 25 Dec 1780. She died in 1871. She married Johan Petter Westling on 20 Mar 1803 in Skellefteå, Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  		F	i	 Maria Johanna (Jeanna) Westling was born on 20 Nov 1804. She died on 30 May 1891. [Notes]
