1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jöns Östensson Smed, born about 1665 in Drängsmark nr 1, died about 1740 Drängsmark, Skellefteå parish, Västerbotten. He belonged to Y-DNA haplogroup R1a-M512>L664>S2894>YP441>YP4123, confirmed by DNA tests on desc
2 CONC endants of at least two of his sons.
