2 CONT Catharina Elisabeth Torsell, f 1710, dotter af landskamreraren i Umeå Lars Torsell och Anna Bröms, d. i Burträsk 18/6 1787. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT Shown on genealogy of Anders Hedström & Olof Hedstöom,  AI:4.69 (1750-1768).
2 CONT Daughter of the country chamberlain (landskamreren) in Umeå, Lars Torsell, and Anna Bröms.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kråken 24 database person 119007, https://kråken.se/ gives source GR102 for birth and death.
